{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"minimalist design\" \"creativity\" \"simplicity\")"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_12_1385122852#17_2849393106","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2426","rank":1,"snippet":"18. House on Wheels in Crete 19. MIMA Light 20. Marfa \" , \"segment\": \"itinyhouses.com This tiny house that looks like a cube is cute and minimalist, making use of every space as good as it can. It is very simple and easy to manage, pushing you to get a minimalism lifestyle with the minimum space it has. 16. Tiny Teahouse by Pietro Belluschi Source: itinyhouses.com A fantastic tea house design using wood material as its interior, giving a cozy feel to the entire room. The sliding door looks like Japanese door, in which they use <cover>simplicity a lot when it comes to architecture. 17. Wall of Shutters Source: itinyhouses.com Who says minimalist design lacks on creativity? </cover>This design shows that even though you are cutting back a lot of furniture and other decorations for minimalism, you can still be creative and create a look that has never been imagined before.\" , \"start_char\": 5557.000000 , \"title\": \"20 Best of Minimalist House Designs [Simple, Unique, and Modern]\" , \"url\": \"https://beyondthepitch.net/minimalist-house-designs/\" }"}}
